{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u201cRISE FROM YOUR BED...\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That\u2019s how V\u2019s nightmare begins: a stressed-out mom and wife, woken by a mysterious voice and dragged into a cursed videogame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now she must beat any foe unlucky enough to cross her path and escape a crazy low-poly world inhabited by strange creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s only one way out: hit everything. With a frying pan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/Progetto_senza_titolo_4_.gif?t=1750414292\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MANY GENRES. ZERO MERCY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">V\u2019s Rage is a hand-drawn arcade adventure inspired by the great arcade classics of the \u201980s and \u201990s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expect frantic combat, absurd enemies, and gameplay rules that change with every stage. Each level throws you into a new experience: Beat \u2019em up, Shoot \u2019em up, Run and Gun, Side-scroller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn, fail, swear, repeat. No tutorials, no guidance. Just pure, classic arcade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/Progetto_senza_titolo_5_.gif?t=1750414292\" /></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BETWEEN ARCADE CABINETS AND \u201980s ANIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">V\u2019s Rage is rooted in the spirit of old-school coin-ops like Final Fight, Altered Beast, and Parodius.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Its visual style is a hand-drawn explosion of \u201980s anime energy, a nostalgic tribute to iconic characters like <i>Lum</i> and <i>Ranma</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/Progetto_senza_titolo.gif?t=1750414292\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2167530?t=1750414292","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/67f0ca61bfd4ad13041b4d7a68277254f2ea00c9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750414292","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/4d4189d430c4bb511494045941eb35062411f98a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750414292","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/4d4189d430c4bb511494045941eb35062411f98a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750414292","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2441990,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u201cRISE FROM YOUR BED...\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That\u2019s how V\u2019s nightmare begins: a stressed-out mom and wife, woken by a mysterious voice and dragged into a cursed videogame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now she must beat any foe unlucky enough to cross her path and escape a crazy low-poly world inhabited by strange creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s only one way out: hit everything. With a frying pan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/Progetto_senza_titolo_4_.gif?t=1750414292\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><